Cargo dependency licenses for ultra-edit

This file lists the licenses for Cargo dependencies used to build ultra-edit
release binaries. It is generated from Cargo.lock; do not edit it directly.

Rust standard library licenses are in RUST_STANDARD_LIBRARY_LICENSES.html.
The musl C library license is in MUSL_COPYRIGHT.
The LLVM libunwind license is in LLVM_LIBUNWIND_LICENSE.txt.
The Rust compiler-builtins license is in RUST_COMPILER_BUILTINS_LICENSE.txt.
The bundled Rust libm license is in RUST_LIBM_LICENSE.txt.
The LLVM compiler-rt license is in LLVM_COMPILER_RT_LICENSE.txt.

